<p>Removing Progressive MCGS causes the largest drop (−13.64 pp medal rate, −8.48 pp beat ratio) — confirming that cross-branch knowledge sharing is the core driver of long-horizon improvement. MLEvolve also outperforms AlphaEvolve on 11 of 15 mathematical algorithm optimization tasks, showing the self-evolving search mechanism generalizes beyond MLE pipelines.</p>
</section>

<!-- Listen-friendly hidden summary -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: MLEvolve — The Self-Evolving MLE Agent That Breaks Branch Isolation</h2>
    <p>Automated machine learning agents typically run multiple search branches in parallel using Monte Carlo Tree Search. The problem is that these branches are information silos — a breakthrough in Branch A cannot help Branch C, which may be stuck in a worse region of the solution space. MLEvolve fixes this by converting the tree into a directed graph, adding reference edges that let stagnated branches pull context from top-performing nodes elsewhere in the graph.</p>
    <p>Three innovations combine to drive the results. Progressive MCGS uses an entropy-inspired schedule that shifts search from broad exploration (4.8 effective branches) to focused exploitation (2.8 branches) over time. Retrospective Memory accumulates plan, code, and metric records throughout the search and retrieves them via hybrid BM25 plus FAISS retrieval without requiring extra LLM calls. Hierarchical Planning separates strategy from implementation, with the coder choosing between full rewrite, stepwise module generation, or targeted diff patches depending on search state. On MLE-Bench with 75 Kaggle tasks, MLEvolve achieves 65.3% medal rate at half the standard 12-hour runtime, beating all compared methods that had 24 hours. Beat ratio reaches 98.2% versus 70.7% for Vanilla MCTS.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：MLEvolve — 打破分支孤立的自进化机器学习工程智能体</h2>
    <p>自动化机器学习智能体通常使用蒙特卡洛树搜索并行运行多个搜索分支，但这些分支彼此相互隔离——A分支的突破无法帮助陷入局部最优的C分支。MLEvolve通过将树结构转换为有向图来解决这一问题，新增的参考边允许停滞分支从图中其他高性能节点获取上下文信息。</p>
    <p>三项核心创新共同推动了最终结果：渐进式蒙特卡洛图搜索利用基于熵的调度策略，将搜索从宽泛探索（4.8个有效分支）逐步收窄到聚焦利用（2.8个有效分支）；回溯式记忆模块在搜索过程中持续积累方案、代码和指标记录，通过BM25与FAISS混合检索在无需额外LLM调用的情况下完成经验复用；层次化规划将策略与实现分离，编码器根据搜索状态在全量重写、逐模块生成和差异补丁三种模式间自适应切换。在包含75个Kaggle任务的MLE-Bench基准上，MLEvolve仅用12小时即达到65.3%的奖牌率，超越所有使用24小时的对比方法，击败人类参赛者的比例高达98.2%。</p>
